     "e": "📚",
     "t": "{name} reads about Tamer. Tamer studied hard every day for his math exam."
    },
    {
     "e": "😬✍️",
     "t": "On the exam day, he felt nervous. Then, he answered all the questions."
    },
    {
     "e": "💯",
     "t": "Later, the teacher told him that he got full marks. Tamer felt very proud and happy."
    },
    {
     "e": "👏",
     "t": "He celebrated with his family at home. They clapped, smiled, and said, 'Well done!' It was a great day."
    },
    {
     "e": "🏃‍♀️",
     "t": "Yara is a fast runner. She practices every day at the school field."
    },
    {
     "e": "🤝",
     "t": "One day, her friend needed help getting ready for a race. Yara showed her how to run and practice. They ran together every day."
    },
    {
     "e": "🏅",
     "t": "On race day, her friend ran well and smiled. Yara felt happy. They both celebrated their success with big cheers."
    }
